        "original_id": "207cbcfc-2c97-5498-81ef-90f2a0d34760",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Conway, Will Geer\n- Works: The Billion Dollar Hobo, McHale's Navy, The Carol Burnett Show, Dorf series, SpongeBob SquarePants\n- Roles: Ensign Charles Parker, Barnacle Boy\n\nFacts:\n- The Billion Dollar Hobo is a 1977 American comedy film starring Tim Conway and Will Geer.\n- The Billion Dollar Hobo was Will Geer’s last role.\n- Tim Conway is known for playing the inept Ensign Charles Parker in the 1960s World War II situation comedy McHale's Navy.\n- Tim Conway is known for sketch comedy as a co-star on the 1960s variety program The Carol Burnett Show.\n- Tim Conway starred as the title character in the Dorf series of comedy films.\n- Tim Conway did cartoon voice work as Barnacle Boy in the animated series SpongeBob SquarePants.",
